Implement user story AMSD-2041: [GO, UP, MX] Live Preview of Content in CMS

## Story Description
[GO, UP, MX] Live Preview of Content in CMS — integrate Contentstack Live Preview SDK so that CMS editors see real-time content changes reflected on the preview page without requiring a publish cycle. Applies across all three codelines (gotransit, upexpress, metrolinx) which share the same useContent hook and contentstack service initialization.

